      &lt;td colspan='3' rowspan='1' style='height: 90px; width: 291px;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;Japan's massive earthquake caused a power outage that disabled a nuclear reactor's cooling system, triggering evacuation orders for about 3,000 residents as the government declared its first-ever state of emergency at a nuclear plant.&amp;nbsp;
